						<h3>Why do CBD brands need SEO more than other ecommerce?</h3>
						<p>Because the paid channels are closed. Google Ads, Meta, and most major platforms restrict or ban CBD advertising, so the usual paid-acquisition playbook is off the table. That makes organic and AI search the primary scalable way customers find a CBD brand. SEO is not one channel among many for CBD; for most brands it is the channel.</p>
