						<h3>Can CBD brands get cited by ChatGPT and AI Overviews?</h3>
						<p>Yes, but the bar is high. AI engines refuse or hedge on a large share of cannabis and CBD questions, so they cite only a small set of sources they trust. That concentration is the opportunity: the brands that earn that trust capture an outsized share of <a href="/geo/">AI recommendations</a>. We build the compliance, credibility, and content signals that get a CBD brand into that trusted set.</p>
