						<p>Carefully, because it is the whole game. CBD is a <a href="/seo/eeat/">YMYL</a> category, and unsubstantiated health claims are both a legal risk and a ranking risk. We build content that educates and demonstrates expertise without making prohibited therapeutic claims, attribute it to credible authors, and structure it so AI systems can cite it confidently.</p>
